msgid ""
"Serial port protocols (Telem, GPS, etc.) can be adjusted to personal "
"preferences."
msgstr "串口协议（数传、GPS 等）可根据个人偏好调整。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-spracingh7-rf.rst:74
#: 98ab9c440580466988687bbdafd9b5d5
msgid "RC Input"
msgstr "RC 输入"

#: ../../source/docs/common-spracingh7-rf.rst:75
#: abbb2abac0e34518b59e092d9eaf1cad
msgid "Ardupilot does not currently support the integrated ELRS chip."
msgstr "ArduPilot 当前不支持集成的 ELRS 芯片。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-spracingh7-rf.rst:77
#: 0ffe14f0e6d346f4a352cc42f8563675
msgid ""
"RC input is configured on the R2 pin. It supports all serial RC protocols. "
"PPM is not supoorted. For protocols requiring half-duplex serial to transmit"
" telemetry (such as FPort) you should setup SERIAL2 as an RC input serial "
"port, with half-duplex, pin-swap and inversion enabled. For duplex "
"protocols, like CRSF/ELRS, T2 must also be connected to the receiver."
msgstr ""
"RC 输入配置在 R2 引脚上。支持所有串行 RC 协议，不支持 PPM。对于需要半双工串行以发送数传数传的协议（如 FPort），应将 SERIAL2"
" 配置为启用半双工、引脚交换和反相功能的 RC 输入串口。对于双工协议（如 CRSF/ELRS），T2 也需连接到接收机。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-spracingh7-rf.rst:82
#: 2a3b357998c34924bced6279df57b692
msgid ""
"Any UART can be used for RC system connections in ArduPilot also, and is "
"compatible with all protocols except PPM. See :ref:`common-rc-systems` for "
"details."
msgstr ""
"在 ArduPilot 中，任何 UART 都可用于 RC 系统连接，并兼容除 PPM 外的所有协议。详情请参阅 :ref:`common-rc-"
"systems`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-spracingh7-rf.rst:85
#: 241dbc42f5314f72a379f3ee113c2ebf
msgid "OSD Support"
msgstr "OSD 支持"

#: ../../source/docs/common-spracingh7-rf.rst:87
#: 4ffb340405864ad7bd249b7894668969
msgid ""
"Ardupilot does not currently support the integrated OSD chip. UART3 is setup"
" for use with DisplayPort goggles with OSD."
msgstr "ArduPilot 当前不支持集成 OSD 芯片。UART3 已配置用于带 OSD 的 DisplayPort 护目镜。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-spracingh7-rf.rst:91
#: b8f81880a12f401d91bec68bcd6acd6a
msgid "PWM Output"
msgstr "PWM 输出"

#: ../../source/docs/common-spracingh7-rf.rst:93
#: 7f8c92d1be9046b69bfbdfb81642edbd
msgid ""
"The SPRacingH7 RF supports up to 9 PWM outputs. PWM 1-8 support DShot and "
"Bi-Directional DShot. The pads for motor output M1 to M4 on ESC connector 1,"
" and M5 to M8 on ESC connector 2, plus M9 for LED strip or another PWM "
"output."
msgstr ""
"SPRacingH7 RF 最多支持 9 路 PWM 输出。PWM 1–8 支持 DShot 和双向 DShot。ESC 连接器1上的 M1 至 "
"M4，ESC 连接器2上的 M5 至 M8，以及 M9 用于 LED 灯带或其他 PWM 输出。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-spracingh7-rf.rst:97
#: 3fae6b714ef846e6babc529e57cfbdb2
msgid "The PWM is in 5 groups:"
msgstr "PWM 分为 5 组："

#: ../../source/docs/common-spracingh7-rf.rst:99
#: 65e372c22be44b0e88ec96658a303074
msgid "PWM 1-4   in group1"
msgstr "PWM 1–4 在第1组"

#: ../../source/docs/common-spracingh7-rf.rst:100
#: 6dd9f66918e74563a929aadcb5bca799
msgid "PWM 5-8  in group2"
msgstr "PWM 5–8 在第2组"

#: ../../source/docs/common-spracingh7-rf.rst:101
#: 367da035d9e44145a9c182806364afef
msgid "PWM 9 (LED)  in group3"
msgstr "PWM 9（LED）在第3组"

#: ../../source/docs/common-spracingh7-rf.rst:104
#: bb27bbdcb40a4ec580be1a6e26b86ff6
msgid ""
"Channels within the same group need to use the same output rate. If any "
"channel in a group uses DShot then all channels in the group need to use "
"DShot."
msgstr "同一组内的通道必须使用相同的输出速率。如果某组中任一通道使用 DShot，则该组中所有通道都必须使用 DShot。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-spracingh7-rf.rst:109
#: fad8db1ce48a4141b9d5f2f69b076e44
msgid "Battery Monitor Settings"
msgstr "电池监测设置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-spracingh7-rf.rst:111
#: dc13bfce141445108027d6a1763e6cce
msgid ""
"The board has a built-in voltage sesnor and current sensor input from the "
