#: ../../source/docs/common-spracingh7-rf.rst:117
#: 555fa4eef69e4210bad4e8c68d69cc46
msgid "BATT_CURR_PIN 11"
msgstr "BATT_CURR_PIN 11"

#: ../../source/docs/common-spracingh7-rf.rst:118
#: 92fb2905bf1a45969ac1dc3356d0d3a5
msgid "BATT_VOLT_MULT 10.9"
msgstr "BATT_VOLT_MULT 10.9"

#: ../../source/docs/common-spracingh7-rf.rst:119
#: a4eccec615a3481c9720445ed82b581a
msgid ""
"BATT_AMP_PERVLT 28.5 (will need adjustment for the current sensor range of "
"the ESC)"
msgstr "BATT_AMP_PERVLT 28.5（需根据 ESC 的电流传感器量程调整）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-spracingh7-rf.rst:122
#: f9940a740747494b8f2c83e0286e335a
msgid "VTX Supply Switch"
msgstr "VTX 供电开关"

#: ../../source/docs/common-spracingh7-rf.rst:123
#: 66a07ee636e641aead6c42fab997fdcd
msgid "Set the ``RELAYx_PIN`` to \"81\" for on/off of VTX power pad."
msgstr "将 ``RELAYx_PIN`` 设置为 「81」 以开关 VTX 电源焊盘。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-spracingh7-rf.rst:125
#: 22bd396e0fe340b6ae6b3f3ccb0f4180
msgid ""
"Then select an RC channel for control (Chx) and set its ``RCx_OPTION`` to "
"the appropriate Relay (1-4) that you had set its pin parameter above."
msgstr "然后选择一个 RC 通道（Chx）进行控制，并将其 ``RCx_OPTION`` 设置为上方引脚参数所设置的相应继电器（1–4）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-spracingh7-rf.rst:127
#: dccf7d47e6664365b81bc029adde9754
msgid "For example, use Channel 10 to control the power using Relay 2:"
msgstr "例如，使用通道10通过继电器2控制电源："

#: ../../source/docs/common-spracingh7-rf.rst:129
#: 089eab47fbf04cc58da5fd917b195a32
msgid ""
":ref:`RELAY2_PIN<RELAY2_PIN>` = \"81\" (Relay 2 is set by default, but can "
"be changed)"
msgstr ":ref:`RELAY2_PIN<RELAY2_PIN>` = 「81」（继电器2已为默认设置，但可更改）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-spracingh7-rf.rst:130
#: 5f600da0619c4753be390477be1bdd89
msgid ":ref:`RC10_OPTION<RC10_OPTION>` = \"34\" (Relay2 Control)"
msgstr ":ref:`RC10_OPTION<RC10_OPTION>` = 「34」（继电器 2 控制）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-spracingh7-rf.rst:132
#: 3f055701aa5a4fddae1074b38c25ec1d
msgid ""
"setting the above Relay low will turn off that supply. If nothing is "
"assigned, default is powered on."
msgstr "将上述继电器设为低/关将切断该路供电。若未分配，默认为供电开启。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-spracingh7-rf.rst:135
#: 114d3686b0094cd289b637f353a65c99
msgid "NeoPixel LED"
