#: 8f54284844e8407a8362fc3de3e46396
msgid ""
"Firmware for these boards can be found `here "
"<https://firmware.ardupilot.org>`_ in  sub-folders labeled \"SPracingH7RF\"."
msgstr ""
"此板的固件可在 `此处 <https://firmware.ardupilot.org>`_ 的子文件夹 「SPracingH7RF」 中找到。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-spracingh7-rf.rst:151
#: ee562494b50041818250fa6d4bde6510
msgid "Loading Firmware"
msgstr "加载固件"

#: ../../source/docs/common-spracingh7-rf.rst:153
#: 3c1d4b3d37f44b6cbd3cabb169adfbad
msgid ""
"This board stores the flight control software on external flash and requires"
" installing an ArduPilot bootloader while in DFU mode. It is recommended "
"only for advance users. The steps are:"
msgstr "此板将飞控软件存储在外部闪存上，需在 DFU 模式下安装 ArduPilot 引导程序。仅建议高级用户操作，步骤如下："

#: ../../source/docs/common-spracingh7-rf.rst:155
#: 121df87404ea433682fedbc67eab0e0d
msgid ""
"boot the autopilot in DFU mode by connecting the boot0 test pad on the board"
" to 3.3v test pad"
msgstr "通过将板上的 boot0 测试焊盘连接到 3.3V 测试焊盘，以 DFU 模式启动飞控"

#: ../../source/docs/common-spracingh7-rf.rst:156
#: c3c4ddb2fa7742cd8d704aa767972b7a
msgid ""
"download the bootloader .bin file from ArduPilot's `bootloader section "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/tree/master/Tools/bootloaders>`__"
msgstr ""
"从 ArduPilot 的 `引导程序区 "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/tree/master/Tools/bootloaders>`__ "
"下载引导程序 .bin 文件"

#: ../../source/docs/common-spracingh7-rf.rst:157
#: 0926a76e0e234b9699e443a6912d4cbf
msgid ""
"flash the file using a tool like https://www.st.com/en/development-"
"tools/stm32cubeprog.html"
msgstr ""
"使用 https://www.st.com/en/development-tools/stm32cubeprog.html 等工具刷写该文件"

#: ../../source/docs/common-spracingh7-rf.rst:159
#: 6f8f08dacbf14af8a84fa8c50e5021e8
msgid ""
"Now it should be possible to load the ArduPilot firmware via the normal "
":ref:`firmware update procedure <common-loading-firmware-onto-pixhawk>`"
msgstr ""
"之后应可按正常 :ref:`固件更新流程 <common-loading-firmware-onto-pixhawk>` 加载 ArduPilot 固件"
